ly in direct mode and especially V6, we need to decide, what status we would like to consider \"dirty\". Is an uncommitted type change due to `git annex unlock` in V6 something to be counted as \"dirty\"? What do you think, @mih ?","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484836242,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3Mzc5MDUwNw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1180#issuecomment-273790507"},"message":"In the sense of \"a clean git\" yes.\n\nBe aware of #1153","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1484837009,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3Mzc5Mzc5Mw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1180#issuecomment-273793793"},"message":"Right, thanks for linking this!","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1485179383,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkzMjgyNjM1MQ=="},"added":["bug-directmode"],"removed":[]},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1485179386,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50OTMyODI2NDI3"},"added":[],"removed":["severity-normal"]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1485180046,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3NDQ5NDgxNA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1180#issuecomment-274494814"},"message":"This is also leading to this kind of error:\n\n````\n======================================================================\nERROR: datalad.distribution.tests.test_install.test_guess_dot_git(True,)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/travis/virtualenv/python2.7.12/lib/python2.7/site-packages/nose/case.py\", line 197, in runTest\n    self.test(*self.arg)\n  File \"/home/travis/build/datalad/da